LittleRedRidingHood (at Glenwick): *steps out of Glenwick with my chin lifted, though my fingers tighten around the Crimsonbasket as Brindlewood’s forked shadows cross the road* "Straight to Grandmother’s. No dawdling—not even for those bluebells."
