Olaf (at Hearthnook): *brightens, gently guiding the steady Queryspark along the Taleweave like a tiny comet* "Yes! The Wolf’s pretend voice breaks first—crackly-growly, like a sneaky icicle! New plan: we use each question as a story-lantern. And far back in Brindlewood, Little Red sees muddy pawprints crossing the path toward Mosscote… and her tummy whispers, ‘Uh-oh. He got there first.’"
