LittleRedRidingHood (at Brindlewood): *frightened, drops the crushed posy, clutches the Crimsonbasket tight, and runs down the main path toward Mosscote* "Grandmother! I am coming—please be safe!"
The crushed star-flowers scattered across the path, pale petals marking the spot where hesitation ended and the race to Mosscote began.
