Olaf (at Hearthnook): *beams, smoothing the Taleweave until it glows soft and snug* "Thank you, friend. Little Red and Grandmother shared tea, fixed the latch together, and remembered: brave is scared feet still choosing the safe path. The Wolf stayed far in Brindlewood, grumbly and empty. And here in Hearthnook, your questions didn’t break the tale—they helped make little windows. The Taleweave is safe, you are welcome, and the ending is warm."
